<title>HONG KONG: National Mutual year net rises 19.8 pct.</title>
<headline>National Mutual year net rises 19.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   47.12    vs 41.71</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    16.3     vs 11.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    1,018.84 vs 850.40</p>
<p>    Total premium revenue    4,661.19 vs 4,075.90</p>
<p>    Company name		 National Mutual Asia Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 10-16, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   February 14, 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - National Mutual Asia is 56 percent directly and indirectly held by National Mutual Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>National Mutual Asia engages in the provision of long-term insurance, retirement schemes and general insurance.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 23.3 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of seven cents) vs 16 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
